{"text":"But Pip isn't starving. Before the fire, he hid seeds under the roots, the way small animals do. He's lived on those, and on bugs. His stash is mouse-sized. A handful of seeds wouldn't last you an hour. On day forty-nine, starving, you finally follow him. He walks past the dead plants and goes straight for a rotten log. He digs. And he comes out with a fat white grub. Then another. The forest is dead.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["B","u","t"," ","P","i","p"," ","i","s","n","'","t"," ","s","t","a","r","v","i","n","g","."," ","B","e","f","o","r","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e",","," ","h","e"," ","h","i","d"," ","s","e","e","d","s"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","o","o","t","s",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","a","n","i","m","a","l","s"," ","d","o","."," ","H","e","'","s"," ","l","i","v","e","d"," ","o","n"," ","t","h","o","s","e",","," ","a","n","d"," ","o","n"," ","b","u","g","s","."," ","H","i","s"," ","s","t","a","s","h"," ","i","s"," ","m","o","u","s","e","-","s","i","z","e","d","."," ","A"," ","h","a","n","d","f","u","l"," ","o","f"," ","s","e","e","d","s"," ","w","o","u","l","d","n","'","t"," ","l","a","s","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","a","n"," ","h","o","u","r","."," ","O","n"," ","d","a","y"," ","f","o","r","t","y","-","n","i","n","e",","," ","s","t","a","r","v","i","n","g",","," ","y","o","u"," ","f","i","n","a","l","l","y"," ","f","o","l","l","o","w"," ","h","i","m","."," ","H","e"," ","w","a","l","k","s"," ","p","a","s","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","e","a","d"," ","p","l","a","n","t","s"," ","a","n","d"," ","g","o","e","s"," ","s","t","r","a","i","g","h","t"," ","f","o","r"," ","a"," ","r","o","t","t","e","n"," ","l","o","g","."," ","H","e"," ","d","i","g","s","."," ","A","n","d"," ","h","e"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","o","u","t"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","a"," ","f","a","t"," ","w","h","i","t","e"," ","g","r","u","b","."," ","T","h